  "bio": "Chrissa is a promising tattoo trainee based in Jena, Germany, who has been honing her craft since 2020 at the @unartig.tattoo studio. Specializing in fineline, floral, and illustrative tattoos, her work showcases impressive linework, sketching, and abstract artistry that illustrates an evolving skill level in the world of ink and body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Jena, Thuringia, Germany",
  "tattooing_since": "2020"
